@startuml
title Makefile Phase — App Discovery & Compilation

participant "User Make" as Make
participant "Wildcards" as Discover
participant "Metadata generator" as Meta
participant "Compiler scripts" as Compile
participant "build/ folder" as BuildDir
participant "PY image Builder" as PyBuilder

Make -> Discover : Evaluate directory structure\n(user/apps, user/servers)
Discover --> Make : META_APP_NAMES (sorted list)

Make -> Meta : generate_apps_meta.sh default_apps <app names>
Meta --> Make : Created app_names.c

loop For each app in META_APP_NAMES
    Make -> Compile : compile_file_apps.sh\nor compile_dir_apps.sh
    Compile -> BuildDir : create build/<app>/app.bin
end
Make -> PyBuilder : python3 disk_image_builder.py build/ base.img size
PyBuilder --> Make : Image complete
@enduml